    "created_at": "2018-04-11T17:03:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-11T17:03:33Z",
    "body": "I can understand the concern, but it appears browsers use that signature for BMP anyway. See https://test-qmbcfvplnm.now.sh/ (source at https://zeit.co/domenic/test/qmbcfvplnm/source).\r\n\r\nWe could attempt to change the standard, and browsers, but that is a whole process, and I'm not sure browsers will be that motivated to make sniffing work better. They're instead explicitly trying to encourage setting the correct content-types.",
